 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Calculate the simple interest to be paid on a loan with the given principal, annual percentage rate, and number of years. Then calculate the loan payoff, or total to be repaid.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 518454,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Principal <span data-math=\"P\">P</span> = $6,700, annual interest rate <span data-math=\"r\">r</span> = 11.99%, and number of years <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> = 3",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"I = P \\times r \\times t\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"I = 6,700 \\times 0.1199 \\times 3\"></span></p>\n<p>The interest is $2,409.99.</p>\n<p>The loan payoff is the sum of the principal and the interest.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = P + I = 6,700 + 2,409.99 = \\$9109.99\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Interest = $2,409.99, the loan payoff is $9,109.99"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 518455,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Principal <span data-math=\"P\">P</span> = $25,800, annual interest rate <span data-math=\"r\">r</span> = 6.9%, and number of years <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> = 5",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"I = P \\times r \\times t\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"I = 25,800 \\times 0.069 \\times 5\"></span></p>\n<p>The interest is $8,901.</p>\n<p>The loan payoff is the sum of the principal and the interest.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = P + I = 25,800 + 8,901 = \\$34,701\"></span></p>"
    },
